#   # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   # STAGE 5: IMAGE SCAN
#   # Purpose: Scan the built container image for OS and library vulnerabilities.
#   # Gate: pipeline fails on findings at or above SCAN_SEVERITY threshold.
#   # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
